# Whitelist, not blacklist. Everything is ignored by default and only the
# explicitly re-included paths below are tracked, so a new data file dropped
# into this folder can never be committed by accident.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/requirements.txt
!/scripts/
!/docs/

# --- inside the whitelisted folders, exclude what must not be published ---

scripts/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Prevalence figures from the team's unpublished preliminary analysis.
docs/table4_reference.csv

# Nothing under these is publishable: recordings, transcripts, demographics,
# derived tables, name maps, logs. Listed explicitly as well as covered by the
# whitelist above, so the intent is on the record.
/Audios/
/Cleaned Transcripts/
/data/
/outputs/
/logs/
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.json
*.csv
